description:
Finds places of one kind in a city or area from OpenStreetMap: restaurants, cafes, bars, hotels, hostels, museums, attractions, pharmacies, hospitals, supermarkets, ATMs, parking, EV charging, parks… with address, coordinates, opening hours, website and phone when known.
Use when: someone asks for "restaurants in Rome", "museums in Amsterdam", "a pharmacy in Brussels".
Example: {"what":"restaurant","where":"Rome","limit":10}
